    "privacy.ageBody": "Checking is a corporate tool for workers. It is not directed to people under {minAge} and does not knowingly collect data from children or adolescents.",
    "privacy.ageTitle": "10. Minimum age",
    "privacy.automatedBody": "Automatic Activities decide your check-in/check-out automatically based on your location. You have the right to request a review of these decisions through our privacy channel, and you can always turn the feature off and record attendance manually.",
    "privacy.automatedTitle": "8. Automated decisions (art. 20)",
    "privacy.cancel": "Cancel",
    "privacy.configPendingNotice": "Privacy configuration pending: controller details are not filled in yet. Complete PrivacyConfig before publishing.",
    "privacy.confirm": "Confirm",
    "privacy.contactBody": "Hello, I would like to exercise my rights under LGPD art. 18 regarding my personal data.\n\nMy key: {chave}\nRequest: (describe: access, correction, deletion, portability, consent withdrawal, etc.)",
    "privacy.contactDpo": "Contact us about my data (privacy)",
    "privacy.contactSubject": "Data subject request (LGPD) — key {chave}",
    "privacy.controllerBody": "Controller: {controller} (natural person).\nPrivacy and rights contact: {privacyEmail}.\nAs a small-scale processing agent (ANPD Resolution 2/2022), no formal Data Protection Officer is appointed; the e-mail above is the communication channel for data protection matters.",
    "privacy.controllerTitle": "6. Controller and contact",
    "privacy.dataBody": "• Identification: your key (4 characters), name, e-mail and the project(s) you belong to;\n• Credentials: your password (stored encrypted);\n• Location (GPS): precise coordinates, also collected in the background when Automatic Activities are on;\n• Attendance records: check-in/check-out history with date, time and location;\n• Accident Mode: video with audio and your status, only when you use it.",
    "privacy.dataTitle": "2. What data we process",
    "privacy.deleteLocalData": "Erase data from this device",
    "privacy.deleteLocalDataConfirm": "This erases your locally stored data from this device (key, preferences, saved passwords, local logs and pending locations) and signs you out. Records already sent to the server are not affected — to delete those, use 'Request account deletion'. Continue?",
    "privacy.deleteLocalDataDone": "Local data erased from this device.",
    "privacy.heading": "Privacy & Data Protection",
    "privacy.intro": "This policy explains, clearly and accessibly, how Checking processes your personal data, in accordance with Brazil's General Data Protection Law (Law 13.709/2018 — LGPD).",
    "privacy.lastUpdatedLabel": "Last updated",
    "privacy.legalBasisBody": "We process your attendance data based on the controller's legitimate interest in providing the time-attendance service (art. 7, IX). Background location use occurs under your specific, highlighted consent (art. 7, I), which you can withdraw at any time, free of charge, by disabling Automatic Activities. In Accident Mode, video — which may contain health data — is processed to protect life and physical safety (art. 11, II, 'e'). The international transfer of data relies on art. 33 (adequate contractual safeguards) and does not depend on enabling any feature.",
    "privacy.legalBasisTitle": "3. Legal basis (LGPD art. 7)",
    "privacy.openFullPolicy": "Read the full policy (website)",
    "privacy.purposeBody": "Checking is a corporate time-attendance app. We process your data solely to:\n• Record your check-ins and check-outs at your project's workplaces;\n• Perform those records automatically based on your location when you enable Automatic Activities;\n• In case of an accident, coordinate the response and safety (Accident Mode).",
    "privacy.purposeTitle": "1. Why we use your data (purpose)",
    "privacy.requestAccountDeletion": "Request account and data deletion",
    "privacy.retentionBody": "• Attendance history: {retentionHistory};\n• Accident Mode videos: {retentionVideo};\n• On-device Activities log: {retentionLocalDays} days.\nAfter processing ends, data is deleted, except where legal retention applies (LGPD arts. 15 and 16).",
    "privacy.retentionTitle": "4. How long we keep it (retention)",
    "privacy.rightsBody": "At any time and free of charge, you may request:\n• Confirmation that we process your data and access to it;\n• Correction of incomplete, inaccurate or outdated data;\n• Anonymization, blocking or deletion of unnecessary or excessive data;\n• Portability and deletion of consent-based data;\n• Information on whom we share data with;\n• Withdrawal of consent.\nTo exercise these rights, use the buttons below or write to our privacy channel. We respond within LGPD deadlines (art. 19).",
    "privacy.rightsTitle": "7. Your rights (LGPD art. 18)",
    "privacy.securityBody": "We adopt technical measures to protect your data: transmission always over HTTPS, passwords and sessions encrypted on the device, and the offline location queue is also encrypted at rest. Access is restricted and protected by app sandboxing.",
    "privacy.securityTitle": "9. Security (art. 46)",
    "privacy.sharingBody": "Checking does NOT sell your data or share it with advertisers. The app uses no advertising, analytics or third-party tracking SDKs.\n\nWe use a hosting/infrastructure provider that acts as an operator, only under our instructions and to host the service — there is no sharing with third parties for their own purposes.\n\n! International transfer (art. 33): that provider is located outside Brazil ({hostingCountry}), so all data is processed and stored abroad. We adopt contractual safeguards to ensure a level of protection adequate to the LGPD.",
    "privacy.sharingTitle": "5. Sharing and international transfer",
